[node name="Text" type="Label" parent="HelpPanel/Margin/VBox"]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 13
text = "WASD - Move
SPACE - Jump
SHIFT / Q / RMB - Shift Projection (Persp <-> Ortho)
E / LMB - Pick Up / Drop Object
TAB / T - Snap Camera Yaw (45° steps)
R / BACKSPACE - Reset Chamber
H / F1 - Toggle This Guide

ORTHO MECHANICS:
• In Orthographic mode, depth does not diminish screen size.
• Distant platforms aligned in screen space become bridged.
• Moving a held cube in Ortho dynamically shifts its scale based on depth."

